    oe:aboutDisease oed:type_2_diabetes_mellitus ;
    oe:answerText "To describe obesity treatments in real-world settings after discontinuation of semaglutide or tirzepatide and variability in weight change post-discontinuation. This retrospective cohort study used electronic health records from 1 January 2021, to 30 June 2025, in a large health system in Ohio and Florida."^^xsd:string ;
